uptime - shows how long system has been running
free- memory usage
df - to check disk usage eg.df -h
ps(process status) - shows current running processes (snapshot)
eg. ps -A

sudo - admin access (temporarily gives admin privileges)

APT - Advanced Package Tool(app manager) to update, install, remove or search

sudo apt update (tells you if there are packages to install)
sudo apt upgrade/ sudo apt dist-upgrade (upgrade packages)
Search package to install (sudo apt search gimp/package name)
Install package:
sudo apt install htop

| (pipeline) - sends output of one command  into another command 
